0 FILE sp-square-straight-study.ldr
0 // Low parapets replace both outer tile rows with 3022 stud plates; one 6141 pier per original 80 LDU column pitch supports a 3020 lower belt, and staggered 3068b caps tie its modules into a flush continuous coping. Solid rise above the original Y=-208 roof surface is 24 LDU (3 plates); ends terminate exactly at the roof boundary.
0 D 두 직선 회랑 구간을 직렬 연결한 접점 표본. 기둥 피치 80 LDU·열 중심 간격 60 LDU는 비교값이며 최종 규격 아님.
0 // 16 bases and capitals are equal-height plate stacks: 3024/6141/6141 and 6141/6141/3022. Capitals align all four beam sockets; two transition plates restore absent floor studs at the module joint. Beam/eave seat levels remain unchanged.
